    "text": "The sum of all the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>-digit distinct numbers that can be formed with the digits <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> is:"
